@startuml
title Green Rides State Machine Diagram

[*] --> Login

state Login
Login : entry / user should be registered
Login : do / user provide Login Details
Login : exit / login Successful

state JourneyDetails
JourneyDetails : entry / after successful login and destination selection
JourneyDetails : do / display journey details

state DrivingModeChoice <<choice>>
DrivingModeChoice --> DrivingModeActivated
DrivingModeChoice --> OtherOptions

state PlaceToEatSelection <<choice>>
PlaceToEatSelection --> EatHere
PlaceToEatSelection --> OrderFood

state AccidentReporting
AccidentReporting : entry / in case of an accident
AccidentReporting : do / inform relevant authorities

state Notifications
Notifications : entry / during driving or in case of an accident
Notifications : do / send notifications

state Feedback
Feedback : entry / upon completion of journey
Feedback : do / allow users to provide feedback

@enduml
